# Data. The full datasets are fetched, never committed - UN/LOCODE alone is
# about 110,000 rows. The small excerpts under data/snapshots ARE committed, so
# that the test suite and `sextant ingest` run on a clean machine with no
# network, and they are listed explicitly rather than by a wildcard: an ignore
# rule that silently swallows a file the tests depend on is a very confusing
# afternoon.
data/raw/
data/snapshots/*
!data/snapshots/README.md
!data/snapshots/wpi/
!data/snapshots/unlocode/
!data/snapshots/digitraffic/
data/snapshots/digitraffic/archive/
*.zip
*.gz
*.zst

# database files produced by the engine
*.sst
*.log
MANIFEST-*
CURRENT
LOCK
testdb/
sextant-db/
ingesttest_*/
storetest_*/
/tmp_*

# node
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
.env

# editors / os
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
web/*.tsbuildinfo

# scratch render used to eyeball docs/demo.svg
docs/_demo_check.png
